# Normalize text files to LF, but never touch binaries.
# NOTE: `* text eol=lf` (the previous rule) forced text treatment on EVERY
# file, so Git rewrote CRLF->LF inside PNGs/archives on `git add`, silently
# corrupting them. Use text=auto (content-sniffed) plus explicit binary
# patterns so image/asset bytes are stored verbatim.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary (belt-and-suspenders; text=auto also detects these)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.bmp binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.xcf binary
*.psd binary
*.svgz binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.7z binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.bin binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary